import{_ as t,o as a,c as i,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 577 | Acceleration Domain | Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm Adaptation — Ultimate Realm's Acceleration and Feeding-Back","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 577 | Acceleration Domain | Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm Adaptation — Ultimate Realm's Acceleration and Feeding-Back","no":577,"module":3,"tags":["Origin Acceleration Domain","Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm","Ultimate Realm","Feeding-Back","Time-Flow Rate"],"related":["502-Origin Acceleration-Domain Time-Flow-Rate Regulation Principle","14-Unified Cultivation-Realm Classification","98-Extended-Setting Proposal List"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0577_模块3-加速域-衡锚超多元境适配.md","filePath":"en/0577_模块3-加速域-衡锚超多元境适配.md"}`),o={name:"en/0577_模块3-加速域-衡锚超多元境适配.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,d,h){return a(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-577-acceleration-domain-balanced-anchor-hyper-multiverse-realm-adaptation-—-ultimate-realm-s-acceleration-and-feeding-back" tabindex="-1">Entry 577 | Acceleration Domain | Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm Adaptation — Ultimate Realm&#39;s Acceleration and Feeding-Back <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-577-acceleration-domain-balanced-anchor-hyper-multiverse-realm-adaptation-—-ultimate-realm-s-acceleration-and-feeding-back" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 577 | Acceleration Domain | Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm Adaptation — Ultimate Realm&#39;s Acceleration and Feeding-Back&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain Civilizational-Experience System | Benchmark base: Documents 14, 98; Benchmark library: Entry 576</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-when-the-cultivator-stands-above-the-time-system-itself" tabindex="-1">Introduction: when the cultivator stands above the time system itself <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-when-the-cultivator-stands-above-the-time-system-itself" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: when the cultivator stands above the time system itself&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Above Multiverse lies the extended-setting Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm (alias &quot;Hyper-Multiverse Balanced Anchor Realm,&quot; pending terminology-committee calibration). This is the apex realm after the nine-realm system&#39;s extension. The Balanced Anchor cultivator is no longer &quot;a person cultivating within the time system,&quot; but <strong>the time system itself&#39;s anchor</strong> — his consciousness already transcends single-universe and multi-universe categories, directly resonating with Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s (Wanling Hengmao Origin Universe&#39;s) origin laws. He is not time&#39;s user, but time&#39;s guardian (Document 98).</p><p>Six top-level axioms at this realm become ultimate propositions: anti-predation axiom requires ultimate power never used for any form of predation; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires the Balanced Anchor cultivator be Myriad Ranks&#39; highest public servant; collective ascension axiom requires his entire existence solely for Myriad Ranks&#39; shared ascension; causal self-discipline axiom requires he himself be causal self-discipline&#39;s embodiment; law-first axiom takes &quot;Balanced Anchor adapted flow&quot; as law itself, never retconned. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-why-the-ultimate-realm-must-self-limit-acceleration" tabindex="-1">I. Why the Ultimate Realm Must &quot;Self-Limit Acceleration&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-why-the-ultimate-realm-must-self-limit-acceleration" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Why the Ultimate Realm Must &quot;Self-Limit Acceleration&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Balanced Anchor cultivator&#39;s power is already large enough to rewrite time flow itself. At this point discussing &quot;how much acceleration to give him&quot; is meaningless — he himself decides how fast time runs. Thus this realm&#39;s acceleration-gear design question is not &quot;how many multiples,&quot; but &quot;why he is willing to self-limit.&quot;</p><p>The answer lies not in institutions, but in <strong>feeding-back logic</strong>:</p><ul><li>He self-limits acceleration because he knows the faster he runs, the harder it is for Myriad Ranks to keep up;</li><li>He proactively slows because his meaning of existence is lifting Myriad Ranks to walk together;</li><li>He feeds back all acceleration gains to Myriad Ranks, because he has no &quot;personal needs&quot; acceleration must satisfy.</li></ul><p>The Origin Acceleration Domain for the Balanced Anchor cultivator sets not an &quot;acceleration gear,&quot; but a &quot;feeding-back gear&quot;: his sole purpose in entering the acceleration domain is to feed back deduction gains to Myriad Ranks, not to obtain something for himself.</p><h2 id="ii-balanced-anchor-acceleration-gear-parameters" tabindex="-1">II. Balanced Anchor Acceleration-Gear Parameters <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-balanced-anchor-acceleration-gear-parameters" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Balanced Anchor Acceleration-Gear Parameters&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Explanation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Entry Purpose</td><td>Sole: feed back Myriad Ranks</td><td>May not enter for personal purposes</td></tr><tr><td>Flow Gear</td><td>Specified by the Myriad-Rank Council as needed</td><td>Not decided by himself</td></tr><tr><td>Output Ownership</td><td>100% belongs to Myriad Ranks</td><td>Zero private property</td></tr><tr><td>Supervision Level</td><td>Full-dimension + Myriad-Rank rotating supervision</td><td>Ultimate power, ultimate supervision</td></tr><tr><td>Exit Condition</td><td>Exit as soon as feeding-back task completes</td><td>May not linger</td></tr></tbody></table><p>This parameter&#39;s core is &quot;sole purpose, zero output, ultimate supervision.&quot; The Balanced Anchor cultivator in the Origin Acceleration Domain is no longer a &quot;user,&quot; but a &quot;feeder&quot; — he uses the acceleration domain to leave something for Myriad Ranks, not to take something from Myriad Ranks.</p><h2 id="iii-the-time-studies-significance-of-ultimate-feeding-back" tabindex="-1">III. The Time-Studies Significance of Ultimate Feeding-Back <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-time-studies-significance-of-ultimate-feeding-back" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Time-Studies Significance of Ultimate Feeding-Back&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Balanced Anchor cultivator&#39;s feeding-back is not simple &quot;giving resources,&quot; but <strong>time-dimension feeding-back</strong>:</p><ul><li>He deduces for ten thousand years in the acceleration domain, leaves the law framework he deduced to Myriad Ranks, letting them avoid ten thousand years of detours;</li><li>He compiles his understanding of Time Law into the Alaya Network&#39;s underlying rules, making Myriad Ranks&#39; time-domain operation safer;</li><li>He uses his existence itself as a &quot;time anchor,&quot; preventing temporal paradox, civilizational regression, historical reversal.</li></ul><p>This is precisely collective-ascension axiom&#39;s expression at the ultimate realm: <strong>the highest being is not the one who runs fastest, but the anchor that lets everyone run.</strong></p><h2 id="iv-opposition-to-ultimate-dictatorship" tabindex="-1">IV. Opposition to &quot;Ultimate Dictatorship&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-opposition-to-ultimate-dictatorship" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Opposition to &quot;Ultimate Dictatorship&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In the predatory-faction system, a Balanced Anchor-level strong one&#39;s typical behavior is &quot;self-proclaiming ultimate dictator&quot;: treating the whole multiverse as private property, Myriad-Rank beings&#39; fates hanging on his one thought. This behavior&#39;s problems:</p><ol><li>It uses ultimate power for personal will, a civilizational-level disaster;</li><li>It trains &quot;god-emperors,&quot; not &quot;public servants&quot;;</li><li>It ultimately inevitably leads to Myriad Ranks collapsing after one of his breaths.</li></ol><p>Heng Yuan Zhou in the Balanced Anchor acceleration gear makes &quot;feeding-back&quot; the sole admission condition: if not to feed back Myriad Ranks, not allowed to enter the acceleration domain. This rule from time allocation makes &quot;ultimate dictatorship&quot; fundamentally unworkable.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: ultimate power used solely for feeding-back, never for personal idling; law-network load controlled by the Myriad-Rank Council</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: entry purpose solely feeding-back; output 100% to Myriad Ranks; from admission eliminates ultimate predation</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style ultimate strong ones self-proclaim Gu Chensha, Tang-Luo-style dictatorship, the universe is private property; Heng Yuan&#39;s Balanced Anchor cultivator is Myriad Ranks&#39; highest public servant</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the ultimate-realm channel opens to Myriad Ranks; every universe, every lineage&#39;s Myriad Ranks has the opportunity to reach this point</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: feeding-back algorithm, supervision rules, exit process all public; this is the ultimate segment of the open chain</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="vi-the-balanced-anchor-cultivator-s-feeding-back-ledger" tabindex="-1">VI. The Balanced Anchor Cultivator&#39;s Feeding-Back Ledger <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-the-balanced-anchor-cultivator-s-feeding-back-ledger" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. The Balanced Anchor Cultivator&#39;s Feeding-Back Ledger&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Each Balanced Anchor cultivator maintains a public feeding-back ledger: what deductions he did in the acceleration domain each year, what law frameworks he left, how many Myriad-Rank individuals he accompanied. The ledger is public to all Myriad Ranks; anyone may query, question. This ledger is not a medal, but proof of his meaning of existence — if the ledger is long blank, the Anchor Council will question whether he is still fulfilling his ultimate responsibility. This is collective-ascension axiom&#39;s hard constraint at the ultimate realm.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm is the apex after the nine-realm system&#39;s extension. The Origin Acceleration Domain here is no longer a &quot;reward,&quot; but a &quot;tool serving Myriad Ranks.&quot; A cultivator willing to feed back all his ultimate power truly deserves the words &quot;Balanced Anchor&quot; — <strong>the anchor&#39;s meaning is not tying boats to itself, but letting all boats sail safely far.</strong></p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./576_模块3-加速域-多元境适配.html">576-Acceleration-Domain Multiverse Adaptation</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation-Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/98-扩展设定建议清单.html">98-Extended-Setting Proposal List</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const p=t(o,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,p as default};
